  6046  proves to be too small, it is replaced by a larger one on the heap. To get a
  6047  vector of the size required that is aligned for pointers, allocate it as a
  6048  vector of pointers. */
  6049
  6050  PCRE2_SPTR stack_frames_vector[START_FRAMES_SIZE/sizeof(PCRE2_SPTR)];
