  6076  options variable for this function. Users of PCRE2 who are not calling the
  6077  function directly would like to have a way of setting these flags, in the same
  6078  way that they can set pcre2_compile() flags like PCRE2_NO_AUTOPOSSESS with
  6079  constructions like (*NO_AUTOPOSSESS). To enable this, (*NOTEMPTY) and
  6080  (*NOTEMPTY_ATSTART) set bits in the pattern's "flag" function which we now
  6081  transfer to the options for this function. The bits are guaranteed to be
  6082  adjacent, but do not have the same values. This bit of Boolean trickery assumes
  6083  that the match-time bits are not more significant than the flag bits. If by
  6084  accident this is not the case, a compile-time division by zero error will
